			},
			"date": "2023-01-09T17:54:38.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Really looking forward to first-class ESM support for eleventy, that's one of the most wanted features for me. And was very happy about the webc surprise, that closed the technology gap between frontend and backend (code reusability) perfectly. Thanks for your great work! And especially the focus on PE and performance as a baseline for these great tools. This kind of work is really important and much appreciated, in the era of bloated js frameworks.</p>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
